  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0004_ac7a030ce539.png\"/>\n$=-\\frac{\\cos x}{\\left[\\frac{2 x}{\\pi}\\right]+\\frac{1}{2}}=-f(x)$\nTherefore, $f(x)$ is an odd function."
